  "plain" : [
    {"label":{"number":1},"text":"O LORD, how my foes have increased! How many rise up against me!"},
    {"label":{"number":2},"text":"Many say of me, “God will not deliver him.” Selah"},
    {"label":{"number":3},"text":"But You, O LORD, are a shield around me, my glory, and the One who lifts my head."},
    {"label":{"number":4},"text":"To the LORD I cry aloud, and He answers me from His holy mountain. Selah"},
    {"label":{"number":5},"text":"I lie down and sleep; I wake again, for the LORD sustains me."},
    {"label":{"number":6},"text":"I will not fear the myriads set against me on every side."},
    {"label":{"number":7},"text":"Arise, O LORD! Save me, O my God! Strike all my enemies on the jaw; break the teeth of the wicked."},
    {"label":{"number":8},"text":"Salvation belongs to the LORD; may Your blessing be on Your people. Selah"}
  ],
